---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: operator or admin ends sale
    q_check_caller --> q_check_not_ended: caller is Legion operator OR projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_ended --> q_end: hasEnded == false
    q_check_not_ended --> q_revert_ended: already ended
    q_end --> q_set_refund: hasEnded = true, endTime = block.timestamp
    q_set_refund --> [*]: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds, emit SaleEnded(endTime)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert AlreadyEnded

    note right of q_end
        INV-001: Joint authority - either Legion operator or projectAdmin can end
        INV-002: endTime set to current block timestamp (not configurable)
        INV-003: Refund period begins immediately after sale conclusion
    end note
